TI  - Gender violence and femicide in Latin America: a cross-national comparison
AU  - Martinez, Elena
AU  - Gonzalez, Rafael
PY  - 2020
JO  - International Journal of Public Health
AB  - This paper examines patterns of femicide across Latin American countries, comparing legislative frameworks and their effectiveness. Countries with specific femicide legislation showed lower rates of intimate partner homicide. Brazil, Mexico, and Argentina are compared in detail. The study found that implementation quality matters more than legislation alone.
